              f"Plants of {n(min(rsm), 2)}–{n(max(rsm), 2)} million cubic metres a year come closest, from €{n(min(rsv), 2)} to €{n(max(rsv), 2)} million per site per year, and are ahead in {p(PR['rightsized_beats_hp_only'], 0)} of model draws; without the backup that keeps heat firm, their heat pumps would leave {prng(rsu, lang, 1)} of low-temperature heat unserved during outages. "
